  <summary>&lt;p>Audio visualizer powered by CAVA&lt;br />&lt;br />Requires installing cava qt6-websockets and python-websockets packages or their equivalents for your distribution!&lt;br />&lt;br />Check the README on GitHub for more detailed instructions: &lt;a href="https://github.com/luisbocanegra/kurve">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://github.com/luisbocanegra/kurve">https://github.com/luisbocanegra/kurve&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;b>Support the development ❤️&lt;/b>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;/p>&lt;ul>&lt;li> GitHub Sponsors &lt;a href="https://github.com/sponsors/luisbocanegra">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://github.com/sponsors/luisbocanegra">https://github.com/sponsors/luisbocanegra&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Ko-fi &lt;a href="https://ko-fi.com/luisbocanegra">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://ko-fi.com/luisbocanegra">https://ko-fi.com/luisbocanegra&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Buy Me A Coffee &lt;a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/luisbocanegra">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/luisbocanegra">https://www.buymeacoffee.com/luisbocanegra&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> PayPal &lt;a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Y5TMH3Z4YZRDA">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Y5TMH3Z4YZRDA">https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Y5TMH3Z4YZRDA&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Liberapay &lt;a href="https://liberapay.com/luisbocanegra/">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://liberapay.com/luisbocanegra/">https://liberapay.com/luisbocanegra/&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;/ul></summary>
